WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:11.010
I remember the first time when I stepped on the pedal

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:12.700
I love how quiet it is

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.360
I love how seamless it is

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.220
How it pulls off from zero, and that speed and that power and that torque

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.800
The favourite features that I continue to love about Tesla is the software updates

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.860
It is the feeling that your car is always new

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.360
I felt so safe inside

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.640
Everything was set-up and everything was so easy

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.740
I personally really like using the app thats how I could always check when I should charge the car

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.320
Driving in Hong Kong is pretty hectic

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.140
There’re a lot of cars coming in and out

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.060
I think it is so hard in Hong Kong to find a peace of mind

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.420
No matter if you re on a bus or even in a car with an engine

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.920
And with a Tesla, it makes so much easier especially with the Autopilot on the highways

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.920
It is almost like to me swimming

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.460
You find the peace and then you can hear that inner voice of yours

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.800
You will always remember it

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.600
You will always remember that feeling

